{"id":35666,"vol":{"id":4937,"name":"Spawn"},"num":"1","name":"Questions Pt.1","title":"Spawn #1","year":"1992","date":"1992-05-01","store":"1992-05-10","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/5/56044/2466969-spawn__1992__001.jpeg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/5/56044/2466969-spawn__1992__001.jpeg","pub":"Image","deck":"","desc":"While a strange assailant stalks the city, ripping out human hearts, another otherworldly being arrives. As his mind reels, our tortured hero remembers that he struck a deal with the devil in order to return to his beloved wife - five years after his death. The man who was Al Simmons is no more. He has become Spawn.\n\nThis issue was a wild success selling 1.7 million copies during its launch.","people":[{"id":42819,"name":"Chris Ulm","role":"editor"},{"id":42820,"name":"Dan Danko","role":"production"},{"id":67147,"name":"Dave Olbrich","role":"other"},{"id":26993,"name":"Ken Steacy","role":"cover"},{"id":67334,"name":"Kim Scholter","role":"other"},{"id":25108,"name":"Reuben Rude","role":"colorist"},{"id":7359,"name":"Steve Oliff","role":"colorist"},{"id":3380,"name":"Todd McFarlane","role":"writer, artist, cover"},{"id":50129,"name":"Tom Mason","role":"other"},{"id":19254,"name":"Tom Orzechowski","role":"letterer"},{"id":67333,"name":"Ty Rulli","role":"other"},{"id":41434,"name":"Wanda Kolomyjec","role":"editor"}],"chars":[{"id":3381,"name":"Spawn","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/1/18154/8836045-0793596987-_427a.jpg"},{"id":3394,"name":"Wanda Fitzgerald","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/0/4875/251107-181300-wanda-fitzgerald.jpg"},{"id":3388,"name":"Twitch Williams","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11141/111417740/9830184-%D9%A2%D9%A0%D9%A2%D9%A5%D9%A0%D9%A8%D9%A1%D9%A6_%D9%A1%D9%A7%D9%A1%D9%A4%D9%A5%D9%A9.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":55963,"name":"\"Spawn\" Questions"}]}